        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-1971P, Back-To-Back Designer Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back Designer Door Pull Set comes packaged as a pair of 2 door pulls. This modern door pull set is a great addition to contemporary business buildings as well as residential properties. Omnia's BTB-1971P Back-To-Back Designer Pull Set is available in 12 inch and 18 inch sizes. Choose from a beautiful selection of modern finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-1971P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/designer-elite-door-pull-omnia-1971p\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Designer Omnia 1971P Back-to-Back Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BTB-1971P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-11/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BTB-1971P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-9/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair with 2 door Pulls</i>\r\n</p>",
